# Enforce LF line endings for all text in the repo. Biome, eslint,
# and CI runners expect LF; without this, a contributor on Windows
# with `core.autocrlf=true` can commit files that CI sees as CRLF
# and fail formatting on otherwise-identical content.
*           text=auto eol=lf

# Known-binary extensions — never touch line endings.
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.gif       binary
*.webp      binary
*.ico       binary
*.woff      binary
*.woff2     binary
*.pdf       binary
